Now it works.

For the record, this is the solution:

######################################################
library(affy)

Data <- ReadAffy(file="/home/johndoe/GSM492799.CEL.gz")

pkg <- cleancdfname(cdfName(Data))
ok <- require(pkg, character.only=TRUE)
if (!ok)
   stop(pkg, " not found; install using biocLite?")

eset <- rma(Data)
########################################################

Thank you!

Ivan



